      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w11.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方の浜は、潮と火薬と、焼きとうもろこしの匂いがした。海の花火大会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この日だけ、街がまるごと海辺へ引っ越す。闘技場も、今夜は休み。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの面々も、私服(と呼んでいいのか分からない何か)で集合した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日は監督業も休み。引率係だけ、ちょっとやる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街の花火は、七世界仕様だった。人魚の花火は、海の中で開く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "水面の下で光の花が咲いて、波ごと光る。竜のお客様は、打ち上げに参加しない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「自前があるので」と、たまに空へ火を吐く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "番組表に無い花火、見つけちゃった。耳が、ぴんと立った。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "幽霊のご夫妻の花火は、音がしなかった。光だけが、ゆっくり開いて、消える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「音は、こちらで想像するんです」とノノさん。想像した。……いい音が、した。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜店の並びに、見慣れた顔があった。遺失物窓口の、出張市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「花火の夜は、落とし物が増えますから」と、係のお姉さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "棚には番号札つきの光り物。灯りの下だと、ただの綺麗なものに見えた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出張市で、うちの備品を三点、縁あって引き取った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "装備は買うか、こうして縁を結ぶか。二本立てらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣では「英雄の剣(三本目)」のおじいさんが、剣を掲げて花火に対抗していた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.006d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.006d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "剣、負けじと、よく光る。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大玉の時間になると、海が、手伝いを始めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "水柱がそっと立って、花火を空のもっと高いところまで持ち上げる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "観客席で見た、あの波の、祭りの顔だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年の花火は歴代最高、と浜のどこかで誰かが叫んだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ふと横を見ると、うちの三人が、並んで空を見上げていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "強いとか、封印とか、契約とか、ぜんぶ置いてきた横顔だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この横顔が見られただけで……今夜の引率係、大成功。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、砂だらけの靴で歩きながら、手帳に一行だけ書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「装備: 三点(縁あり)。花火: 想像した音つき」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w11.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……うちの手帳、記録簿としてどんどん駄目になっていく。いい傾向だと思う。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w11.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
